  "title": "Implement Filesystem Fallback Mode",
  "description": "Implement a filesystem fallback mode that allows agents to operate when the MCP server is unavailable. In fallback mode, the SDK delegates operations to the existing `tickets.py` CLI. This enables a gradual migration from filesystem to MCP-based operations. The mode is controlled by a feature flag (environment variable FORGEOS_MODE=mcp|filesystem|auto).",
